description:
Design a circuit that computes both the sum and product of the two 8-bit segments of a 16-bit input signal. The lower 8 bits are added to the upper 8 bits, and their product is calculated, with the resulting 24-bit output combining the sum (lower 8 bits) and product (upper 16 bits). The module effectively serves as a dual-function signal processor that outputs the sum and product of the respective segments in a single output signal.
module top_module(
    input [15:0] input_signal,
    output [23:0] output_signal
);

code:
module top_module(
    input [15:0] input_signal,
    output [23:0] output_signal
);wire [7:0] first_8_bits = input_signal[7:0];
    wire [7:0] last_8_bits = input_signal[15:8];
    wire [23:0] sum_prod_result = {first_8_bits + last_8_bits, first_8_bits * last_8_bits};

    assign output_signal = sum_prod_result;

endmodule

